span class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-muted text-muted-foreground text-xs rounded-md hover:text-foreground transition-colors\">#<!-- -->AI Pilots</span></div><div class=\"mt-16 pt-10 border-t border-border\"><div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-primary-purple mb-5\">About the Author</div><div class=\"flex gap-4 items-start\"><img src=\"https://www.ayautomate.com/adel.webp\" alt=\"Adel Dahani\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full object-cover flex-shrink-0 border border-border\"/><div><div class=\"text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-0.5\">Adel Dahani</div><div class=\"text-[13px] text-muted-foreground mb-2.5\">CTO | Ex IBM</div><p class=\"text-sm leading-[1.65] text-muted-foreground m-0\">Ex-IBM AI engineer and enterprise architect. Adel owns the technical architecture behind every automation and AI agent system AY Automate ships.</p></div></div></div></article></div><section class=\"border-t border-border bg-muted/30 py-[clamp(48px,6vw,80px)]\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-4\"><div class=\"text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-primary-purple mb-8\">More From the Blog</div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><a class=\"group block bg-card border border-border rounded-xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:border-primary-purple/50\" href=\"https://www.ayautomate.com/blog/ai-agent-production-readiness-audit-checklist\"><div class=\"aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden relative bg-muted\"><img alt=\"AI agent production-readiness audit: the checklist before you give it real permissions\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1200px) 50vw, 33vw\" srcSet=\"https://ealqqtdyihheyzgbzihq.supabase.co/storage/v1/ob